  (text "rails join by name; drivers on power sheet"
    (at 181.61 149.86 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "d264a3c4-f16a-422a-b424-d015f8ae0e34")
  )
  (text "NOTES:"
    (at 12.70 190.50 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.524 1.524)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "0d31f7b2-528a-4a9d-90bd-d42bd629b08a")
  )
  (text "1. VDDPIX is the sensor's internal-LDO OUTPUT: bypass caps only, never on a rail."
    (at 12.70 196.85 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "1198c7bd-7b13-4f08-9fba-c5a7c56d380b")
  )
  (text "2. IR LED is integrated in the module; LED_P (anode) via 39R from VSEN_1V9."
    (at 12.70 201.93 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "bd861620-8515-4ef7-afbd-92d2b41e9676")
  )
  (text "3. NCS has no internal pull-up: external 10k. MOTION/MISO are push-pull (no PU)."
    (at 12.70 207.01 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "90380528-2f0c-4b02-bf36-060e7a00f02d")
  )
  (text "4. NRESET: APX809 push-pull + internal weak PU; no external PU fitted."
    (at 12.70 212.09 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "477aa904-3a8d-477d-9090-fdb66e610bf5")
  )
  (text "5. Standalone ERC: 5 expected input-not-driven (drivers on power/mcu); clear at full-project ERC."
    (at 12.70 217.17 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "069c8767-b2b1-4ccf-91a8-0774c799ba23")
  )
  (text "6. PMW3360 footprint custom (layout job); lens Z=2.4+-0.1mm (MECH-002)."
    (at 12.70 222.25 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "687b5a4a-7317-41dc-b591-ec6c1cf2bc5c")
  )
